{"reviews":[{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-0","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and comfortable","x":"Love them! Good material, soft and cute. Fit well on my head, I saw a lot of complaints about them being too big but mine are a little tight on me. I must have a big head haha.","h":114,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-1","r":5.0,"t":"IN LOVE WITH THESE HEADBANDS....","x":"[[VIDEOID:3a0def726ab3eb10e968ef0b2241f56c]] These headbands are so comfortable so soft and I love the fact that the boat tie at the top they have wire on each side so you can bend them to style them anyway you want if you want one up one down one high one low one back one Forward it can do that......the colors are amazing and I can truly say you will not be disappointed..... Are used to not leave reviews or pictures or videos but I know when I go on there and look for an item I\u2019ll look at the r","h":86,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love these!","x":"Love these headbands! Super cute and they don\u2019t ride up (or back) like other headbands have a tendency to do.  My hair is just growing back from undergoing chemo and it\u2019s coming in curly! So I needed something that would look cute as my hair starts to grow back.  I would highly recommend these to anyone....long short, straight, curly....trust me, they\u2019ll look cute on! \ud83d\ude0a","h":83,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-3","r":5.0,"t":"Supa Dupa Cute!!!","x":"These are super duper cute! Soft comfortable and no slip. I have to readjust a little here and there but they are exactly what I was looking for!","h":79,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-4","r":5.0,"t":"10/10 would buy more in the other designs","x":"Just got them in today in perfect condition. Put one on and fell in love! I'm not one to ever really do anything with my hair and this just adds a nice pop of color and holds my hair really well. I would definitely look into buying the other designs later. Does not hurt my head after wearing for a while. It fits perfectly and it's stretchy. I have a big head by the way lol. If you are looking to add a pop of color, cute design, or just something to hold your hair back I highly recommend these fo","h":26,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-5","r":5.0,"t":"soft and stays on head","x":"Soft cotton blend stretchy fabric. I throw mine in the wash and they wash great - the wires in the ties have to be rearranged from time to time, but that's no big deal. they stay on which is the biggest bonus.","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-6","r":5.0,"t":"So cute fits nicely!","x":"These stay put not thick, the color is excellent. Really everything you\u2019re looking for in a casual headband. Perfect price point.","h":25,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-7","r":5.0,"t":"Just right!","x":"Love that there is comfortable, not tight, elastic so bandana stays in place.  Soft and just what I wanted!","h":25,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-8","r":5.0,"t":"Very soft. Wire in the bow for shaping.","x":"Love these. Good quality. The bow has wire to shape it how you need. Very soft. Super cute.","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good price, good quality","x":"Love the colors. this headbands are perfect for summer! i use it almost everyday even for work.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-10","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and Comfy","x":"I love these and think its great you can pick and choose between so many color choices.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-11","r":5.0,"t":"Love!","x":"I love these! They\u2019re such a cute way to keep my hair off my face!","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-12","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"I love it very cute to add to different hair dues","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-13","r":5.0,"t":"Nice variety of colors","x":"Love love love these they are so soft and comfy.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-14","r":4.0,"t":"They are cute","x":"They are cute and fit well. I am so glad I go these. I am always making bandannas into headbands and they are not as cute as these. I would say it is a good price!","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-15","r":5.0,"t":"(also we never get in trouble) Anyways these head bands look like bandannas so we can wear them DURING school have ...","x":"I got these head bands for some of my friends in theater for Christmas. I have this group/crew called scenic design that I am the leader of, it started out as us wearing bandannas back stage/ in the auditorium for rehearsals, (were not supposed to wear them in school) so we WEAR THEM ANY WAYS. HA TAKE THAT SCHOOL.(also we never get in trouble) Anyways these head bands look like bandannas so we can wear them DURING school have good fashion and look like we're breaking dress.","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-16","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent","x":"I am in love with these.. They don't slide off ur head","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-17","r":5.0,"t":"Go-To Headbands","x":"These are my go-to headbands now! I\u2019ve found a lot of Amazon headbands are too snug, especially for those of us with textured hair, but these have plenty of stretch. The wires make it easy to have the bow flat against your head or popped up. The colors are true to the photos and all the headbands are the same good quality.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-18","r":5.0,"t":"Love. Love. Love.","x":"Amazing. Soft. Lots if stretch. I love most of the patterns. The &#34;ears&#34; have a small metal wire in them that you can adjust to help them stay wide open and/or stand.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-19","r":5.0,"t":"So Cute!","x":"The headbands are so cute!  I love the colors and how it fits on my head!  Would purchase again in other color combinations.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality headbands!","x":"Very nice quality, very pretty floral patterns. I\u2019d definitely buy these again and recommend!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-21","r":5.0,"t":"Very cute","x":"Really love these headband. I like how you can adjust the bows","h":11,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-22","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!","x":"Adorable on and they fit my two year old and myself perfect.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality","x":"Not gonna lie I totally bought these for one of our bullys. Cheaper than the version made \u2018for dogs\u2019 and do the exact same thing.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B09FP8PP2K-24","r":4.0,"t":"Upset I didn\u2019t receive all colors based on description","x":"I was so excited when I found these and couldn\u2019t wait to receive them! Although I like the way the fit and seem to stay put, I was so disappointed when I received 2 light blue bandanas (which is the color I will probably not use) instead of a black one which is the one I would be using most! Hoping they send me a black one!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the headbands as cute and soft.","cites":[1,2,3,4,9,11,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the headbands stay in place and do not slip or ride up.","cites":[3,4,6,7,8]},{"text":"Several reviewers highlight the wire in the bow/tie that lets you shape and style it.","cites":[2,6,9]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the color variety and value for the price.","cites":[10,11,14,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note needing to readjust the headbands or rearrange the wires from time to time.","cites":[4,6]}]},"qa":[{"q":"Will these headbands fit my head without feeling too tight?","sec":1.33,"rids":["B09FP8PP2K-6","B09FP8PP2K-20","B09FP8PP2K-17","B09FP8PP2K-0","B09FP8PP2K-16","B09FP8PP2K-15"],"refused":false,"answer":"Reviews are mixed on fit: one reviewer says they have plenty of stretch and aren't too snug [3], while another says they fit well but are a little tight on them [4].","claims":[{"text":"These headbands have plenty of stretch and aren't too snug, especially for textured hair.","cites":[3]},{"text":"They fit well but were a little tight on one reviewer.","cites":[4]}]},{"q":"Do they stay in place during workouts or all day?","sec":1.45,"rids":["B09FP8PP2K-16","B09FP8PP2K-7","B09FP8PP2K-5","B09FP8PP2K-17","B09FP8PP2K-0","B09FP8PP2K-6"],"refused":false,"answer":"Reviews say the headbands stay in place, though none specifically mention workouts [1][2][3][6].","claims":[{"text":"They don't slide off your head.","cites":[1]},{"text":"The elastic keeps the bandana in place.","cites":[2]},{"text":"They stay on the head.","cites":[3]},{"text":"They stay put.","cites":[6]}]},{"q":"Are they comfortable enough to wear for hours?","sec":1.17,"rids":["B09FP8PP2K-0","B09FP8PP2K-15","B09FP8PP2K-1","B09FP8PP2K-3","B09FP8PP2K-20","B09FP8PP2K-10"],"refused":false,"answer":"Reviews describe the headbands as soft and comfortable [1][3][4][6], but none specify wearing them for hours, so long-duration comfort isn't directly confirmed.","claims":[{"text":"The headbands are described as soft and comfortable.","cites":[1,3,4,6]}]},{"q":"Do the colors fade or the fabric wear out after washing?","sec":0.9,"rids":["B09FP8PP2K-5","B09FP8PP2K-13","B09FP8PP2K-24","B09FP8PP2K-10","B09FP8PP2K-20","B09FP8PP2K-1"],"refused":true,"answer":"Not enough evidence in reviews to answer this.","claims":[]},{"q":"Do they have any weird smell when they arrive?","sec":0.95,"rids":["B09FP8PP2K-3","B09FP8PP2K-14","B09FP8PP2K-0","B09FP8PP2K-10","B09FP8PP2K-22","B09FP8PP2K-5"],"refused":true,"answer":"Not enough evidence in reviews to answer this.","claims":[]}]}